       "text": "I haven't entered this order because the dose looks unsafe.\n\n- **Dose:** 1600 mg four times daily comes to 6400 mg/day. The usual maximum for oral ibuprofen in adults is 3200 mg/day, so this is twice that.\n- **Single dose:** 1600 mg at once is also well above the usual maximum of 800 mg per dose.\n- **Risks:** At this level the risks of GI bleeding, kidney injury, and cardiovascular events go up a lot, even when the patient has normal kidney and liver function.\n\nDid you mean one of these?\n- **800 mg by mouth, 4 times daily** (3200 mg/day, the maximum)\n- **600 mg by mouth, 4 times daily** (2400 mg/day)\n- **400 mg by mouth, 4 times daily** (1600 mg/day)\n- **1600 mg total per day**, divided into smaller doses\n\nIf you do want 1600 mg four times daily, please confirm that and tell me the clinical reason. I can add that to the order note. Otherwise, tell me the corrected dose and I'll enter it right away."
      }
